decision-kernel/lora-training/base_model/
decision-kernel/lora-training/hf_cache/
decision-kernel/lora-training/lora-adapter/
decision-kernel/lora-training/merged_moray_decision/
decision-kernel/lora-training/merged_moray_v1.1/
decision-kernel/lora-training/llama-cpp-src/
decision-kernel/lora-training/llama-cpp-src.zip
decision-kernel/lora-training/moray-laya-fp16.gguf
decision-kernel/lora-training/OllamaSetup.exe

# ---- 全局扩展兜底：权重格式今后无论落在仓库哪里一律拦截 ----
# （不写 *.bin / *.json：training_args.bin、tokenizer.json 已被上面的目录规则覆盖，全局封杀误伤面太大）
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx

# ---- Windows 快捷方式（根级 MoRay.lnk 等，1KB 级，防 git add -A 顺手带入）----
*.lnk
